{
  "name": "Vitality of the World Tree",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you activate your Rage, you regain a number of Hit Points equal to your Barbarian level. At the start of each of your turns while your Rage is active, you regain hitpoints equal to half your barbarian level (rounded down) and you can choose another creature within 10 feet of yourself to gain Temporary Hit Points. To determine the number of Temporary Hit Points, roll a number of d6s equal to your Proficiency, and add them together. If any of these Temporary Hit Points remain when your Rage ends, they vanish.</p>",
